{
  "storyId": "B-9e48",
  "name": "done-worktree-root-cleanup",
  "title": "DONE cleanup uses canonical worktree root from subdirectories",
  "description": "SimCell B-e101 exposed a Koala DONE cleanup bug when story_advance DONE is run from a nested directory inside the story worktree. The framework used process.cwd() as the worktree root, so it targeted a child directory for git worktree remove and rm -rf, leaving the real worktree registered and dirty, failing to delete story/B-e101, and merging stale TEST metadata instead of committed DONE metadata. Fix this with hardcoded canonical worktree-root resolution and regression coverage so DONE cleanup is safe and quiet from nested project directories.",
